{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CghyedYjwZTSdmzouCEHD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01YSd51xJ7QKGVx3SVkVuK7u","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\np='NOTES.md'; s=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"- [~] M2 players/match: src/02 teams+players data, 31 player entity, 33 actions (shots, passes, catches). TODO: 35 match flow, 34 CPU brain, 32 pose/dribble, 90 wiring\",\n\"\"\"- [x] M2 core: 02 teams+players data, 31 player entity, 33 actions, 35 match flow (phases, clocks, inbounds, OT, sudden blam), 34 CPU brain (10 Hz, difficulty table), 37 step pipeline (commands, players, ball, rules, Supernova), 38 setup, 36 camera. CPU-vs-CPU full games end without errors (tested 4 seeds).\n- [x] M3 arcade layer (partial): 39 dunks (catalog, choice, decided block/fail, slam), layups, alley-oop, steals, shoves, spin, blocks, goaltend, shatter chance. Pose layer and dunk choreography: NOT YET (rig uses state only).\n- [ ] TODO next: audio (10-12), announcer+captions, effects/banners, pose layer, courts 2-5 + props, twists, power-ups, UI kit + screens (title, menus, join, team select, matchup, results, pause), tour+story+camp, attract+dev, AI Hub (50), tests suites, About text, exit-interview.json.\n- Balance (later, M11): CPU scores ~15-40 per team per quarter-min; dunks too frequent (~1 in 2 baskets); steal/shove counts high.\"\"\")\ns=s.replace(\"- Engine changes planned (list in About + exit interview)\",\"- Build rule: ALWAYS run `node tools/build.mjs` before tests or debug scripts (helpers load build/game.js).\\n- Engine changes planned (list in About + exit interview)\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s); print('ok')\nEOF","description":"Record progress and the build rule in the notes"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3293,"cache_read_input_tokens":388217,"cache_