{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgi1XvRH2ycnbZxbpaAzb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Balance is close to the plan now. Dunks are about one in four baskets, Supernova ignites several times a game, and shot-clock violations are about two a game. Substitutions never happen, though, because juice only falls on knockdowns. The plan says it also falls while a player is on court and while turbo is held, so I'll add those drains and recheck."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3605,"cache_read_input_tokens":625056,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3605},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0432b045-5008-4207-9914-efcb595d2dad","uuid":"e6a9ef2e-facd-41c3-b297-f84d6176fe90","timestamp":"2026-11-04T14:01:18.173Z","request_id":"req_011Cgi1XuwWQxcBvmWNco4YA"}
