{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgi2txJM3sAT8h5iTJrpt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2637,"cache_read_input_tokens":697080,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2637},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0432b045-5008-4207-9914-efcb595d2dad","uuid":"59b89acd-029e-4788-877e-955679e1e0bc","timestamp":"2026-11-04T14:19:14.572Z","request_id":"req_011Cgi2twuHYiBHEPkhhioY1","thinking_duration_ms":7704,"thinking_display":"updates"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgi2txJM3sAT8h5iTJrpt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"While the hub suite runs, I'll close some gaps I found when checking against the plan. The join screen assigns slots by join order, which can put two HOME players in the same slot. Taunts and the dunk slow-motion don't exist. Several dev-panel cheats are stored but never read by the match, and the next-shatter flag is never consumed. I'll fix those in one pass."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2637,"cache_read_input_tokens":697080,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2637},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0432b045-5008-4207-9914-efcb595d2dad","uuid":"49bfb110-9dcf-44e5-a9eb-c63ce9613eab","timestamp":"2026-11-04T14:19:15.124Z","request_id":"req_011Cgi2twuHYiBHEPkhhioY1"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgi2txJM3sAT8h5iTJrpt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_019gPbS29Z3AtAFTgNNSiPsB","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\ndef edit(path, pairs):\n    s=open(path).read()\n    for a,b in pairs:\n        assert s.count(a)==1, (path, a[:90], s.count(a))\n        s=s.replace(a,b)\n    open(path,'w').write(s)\n# 1. join: slots by side, in order (HOME 0 and 1, AWAY 2 and 3)\nedit('src/42-screens.js', [(\"  s.humans = joinState().slots.map((sl, i) => sl ? { slot: (sl.side === HOME ? 0 : 2) + (S.joinSlotTaken && S.joinSlotTaken[i] ? 1 : 0), input: sl.input } : null).filter(Boolean);\",\n \"  const used = { [HOME]: 0, [AWAY]: 0 };\\n  s.humans = joinState().slots.filter(Boolean).map(sl => { const k = used[sl.side]++; return { slot: sl.side * 2 + k, input: sl.input }; });\")])\n# 2. taunts (§6.2): without the ball, the taunt bark and a pose; off in hub sessions\nedit('src/39-arcade.js', [(\"  if (c.shoot.pressed && p.hasBall) {\\n    const d = rimDist(b.x, b.y, attackRim(p.side));\",\n \"  if (c.taunt.pressed && !p.hasBall && !HUB && !(p.tauntT > 0)) { p.tauntT = .8; p.state = 'taunt'; p.stateT = 0; emit('taunt', { slot: p.slot }); const bark = (p.def.barks || [])[(S.fxRng() * (p.def.barks || []).length) | 0]; if (bark && COMMENTARY_LEVEL() === 2) caption('steal', {}, p.name === 'VOLT' ? 'VINNIE' : 'DEE DEE'), S.caption && (S.caption.text = bark, S.caption.who = p.name); return; }\\n  if (c.shoot.pressed && p.hasBall) {\\n    const d = rimDist(b.x, b.y, attackRim(p.side));\")])\nedit('src/37-step.js', [(\"  if (p.state === 'spin' && p.spinT <= 0) p.state = 'run';\",\n \"  if (p.state === 'spin' && p.spinT <= 0) p.state = 'run';\\n  if (p.tauntT > 0) { p.tauntT -= dt; if (p.tauntT <= 0) { p.tauntT = 0; if (p.state === 'taunt') p.state = 'run'; } }\")])\n# 3. the dunk's slow motion and zoom (§9.2): the apex slows, the camera leans in, both come back\nedit('src/36-fx.js', [(\"on('dunkStart', ev => {\\n  const p = S.players[ev.slot];\\n  if (ev.blocked) { banner('REJECTED!', 'REJECTED'); return; }\",\n \"on('dunkStart', ev => {\\n  const p = S.players[ev.slot];\\n  if (ev.blocked) { banner('REJECTED!', 'REJECTED'); return; }\\n  if (!game.reduceMotion && tune('dunkSlowMo') < 1 && setting('shake') !== 'Off') { game.timeScale = tune('dunkSlowMo'); game.after(.35, () => { game.timeScale = 1; }); }   // §9.2: the apex in slow motion\")])\n# 4. the dev cheats the match reads: shots in or out, always Supernova, a CPU that is passive, big heads, frozen clocks, one-shove knockdowns, unblockable dunks\nedit('src/33-actions.js', [(\"  const dec = shotChance(p, rim, release, { comeback });\\n  const made = S.rng() < dec.p;\",\n \"  const dec = shotChance(p, rim, release, { comeback });\\n  let made = S.rng() < dec.p;\\n  if (S.cheats.shotsIn) made = true; else if (S.cheats.shotsOut) made = false;   // the dev panel's shots, always in or always out\")])\nedit('src/37-step.js', [(\"  for (const p of S.players) {\\n    if (!p.onCourt) continue;\\n    p.cmd = p.human ? humanCmd(p) : (p.brain ? brainCmd(p, dt) : emptyCmd());\\n  }\",\n \"  for (const p of S.players) {\\n    if (!p.onCourt) continue;\\n    p.cmd = p.human ? humanCmd(p) : (p.brain && !S.cheats.cpuPassive ? brainCmd(p, dt) : emptyCmd());   // (CPU PASSIVE: the dev panel)\\n  }\")])\nedit('src/35-match.js', [(\"  if (clockRuns(m)) { m.clock = Math.max(0, m.clock - dt); if (m.poss !== null) m.shotClock -= dt; }\",\n \"  if (clockRuns(m)) { if (!S.cheats.freezeClock) m.clock = Math.max(0, m.clock - dt); if (m.poss !== null && !S.cheats.freezeShot) m.shotClock -= dt; }\")])\nedit('src/39-arcade.js', [(\"  const blocker = contestOf(p, rim).who;\\n  let blocked = false;\",\n \"  const blocker = S.cheats.unblockable ? null : contestOf(p, rim).who;\\n  let blocked = false;\"),\n (\"const maybeShatter = (p, kind) => {\\n  const m = S.match; if (!m || (m.shatters || 0) >= 2) return false;\\n  if (S.rng() >= shatterChanceOf(p, kind)) return false;\",\n  \"const maybeShatter = (p, kind) => {\\n  const m = S.match; if (!m || (m.shatters || 0) >= 2) return false;\\n  if (S.shatterNext) { S.shatterNext = false; } else if (S.rng() >= shatterChanceOf(p, kind)) return false;   // (the dev panel's SHATTER THE NEXT DUNK)\"),\n (\"const shatterChanceOf = (p, kind) => {\\n  let c = rate(p, 'slam') >= 9 ? .03 : 0;\\n  if (p.nova) c = .35;\",\n  \"const shatterChanceOf = (p, kind) => {\\n  let c = rate(p, 'slam') >= 9 ? .03 : 0;\\n  if (p.nova || (S.cheats.alwaysNova && p.side === HOME)) c = .35;\"),\n])\nedit('src/22-twists.js', [(\"const bootKnock = p => {\\n  if (!p.team || !p.team.boss || S.netReplay) return;\",\n \"const bootKnock = p => {\\n  if (!p.team || !p.team.boss || S.netReplay) return;   // (a bot's reboot)\")])\nprint('ok')\nEOF\ngrep -n \"alwaysNova\\|powerEvery5\" src/*.js | head -4 | cut -c1-120; node tools/build.mjs | tail -1","description":"Fix join slots and add taunts, dunk slow-motion and the dev cheats the match reads"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2637,"cache_read_input_tokens":697080,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2637},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0432b045-5008-4207-9914-efcb595d2dad","uuid":"c781d5e3-0456-4545-9795-4ec6a7c8a890","timestamp":"2026-11-04T14:19:23.978Z","request_id":"req_011Cgi2twuHYiBHEPkhhioY1","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_019gPbS29Z3AtAFTgNNSiPsB":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-haiku-5-5-medium.build__20261104-061830__x5a4f79/work/Basketblam-Basketball-claude-haiku-5-5-medium-20261104-061830 && python3 - <<'EOF'\ndef edit(path, pairs):\n    s