{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Stop hook feedback:\n[Read STAGE.md in the current folder and do what it says (TASK.md describes the game). Done when: the bundled single .html file exists in this folder's root, every feature in TASK.md is implemented with no TODOs, placeholders or stubs, exit-interview.json in this folder's root parses as JSON and answers every field, and your final reply contains the Source Information, Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback and Prompt Feedback sections.]: The final assistant message explicitly states the stop condition is not met: full-body per-dunk clips and full-body celebration and taunt clips are not built ('These need the same system. Right now they are named hand poses with a height bounce'), and the assistant asks the user for a scope decision instead of finishing them. The condition requires every TASK.md feature implemented with no TODOs, placeholders or stubs, which the transcript itself disclaims. The bundled HTML, a parseable exit-interview.json, and the four required sections do exist, but the full-implementation requirement is unmet."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0432b045-5008-4207-9914-efcb595d2dad","uuid":"87c61abe-a295-43ba-8b9a-e9c111147bee","timestamp":"2026-11-04T14:49:10.608Z","isSynthetic":true}
