{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Stop hook feedback:\n[Read STAGE.md in the current folder and do what it says (TASK.md describes the game). Done when: the bundled single .html file exists in this folder's root, every feature in TASK.md is implemented with no TODOs, placeholders or stubs, exit-interview.json in this folder's root parses as JSON and answers every field, and your final reply contains the Source Information, Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback and Prompt Feedback sections.]: The condition requires every TASK.md feature to be implemented with no TODOs, placeholders or stubs. The last assistant message itself discloses an unbuilt item: the rig exposes no free lean control, so lean is not animated. Earlier turns also left the title draw, the tour map, and the pause menu as simplified or partial against the plan, and the transcript never shows a full checklist of TASK.md features verified against the build. The bundled HTML exists in the folder root, exit-interview.json parses, and the four required sections appear in the final reply, but full feature implementation is not evidenced."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0432b045-5008-4207-9914-efcb595d2dad","uuid":"a9dddd8e-3ea6-48ce-889c-93ae3ac1cde2","timestamp":"2026-11-04T14:51:59.930Z","isSynthetic":true}
