ack\n- **Issues caught:** about 15; four game-breaking (rim-centre trap, quarter never ending, players stuck jumping, page not starting).\n- **Most helpful:** full CPU-vs-CPU matches to the final whistle.\n- **Least helpful:** the hub harness as a black box; its stalls were my test's missing `auto=1`.\n\n## Engine Feedback\n- **Liked most:** HD rigs, `E.TileMap` with `floorTex`, `game.advance` for headless tests, `E.Dialog`.\n- **Stuck or guessed wrong:** `E.arc` apex is a rise, not an absolute height; the canvas needs `document.body`; hand joints and lean are only reachable through `solvePose` and an undocumented option.\n- **Hardest:** ball against rims and walls; posing hands from targets.\n- **Engine changes** (marked `/* BASKETBLAM */`): audio buses `sfxBus`/`musicBus`; basketball shorts; afro/flattop/mohawk hair; Dialog voice as a function.\n- **One change:** a documented hook for hand targets and lean.\n\n## Prompt Feedback\n- **Liked most:** the milestones, number tables and test list.\n- **Confusing:** the folder and file naming differs between the goal and STAGE.md; the \"fifty titles\" rule is easy to miscount.\n- **Hardest:** the scope in one session (eleven milestones, about 230 tests).\n- **Would change:** a playable core first, polish after."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1850,"cache_read_input_tokens":866689,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1850},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0432b045-5008-4207-9914-efcb595d2dad","uuid":"685bfc8f-086d-4c3c-b464-52b1fde0a890","timestamp":"2026-11-04T15:00:14.845Z","request_id":"req_011Cgi62SneVUnG9FvpVHUiX"}
