{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgi65UWQckfwcQS6J1AL7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I checked the tour map against the plan's §11.4 list, and every listed element is in the source: the five places, the dotted route, medallions with W stamps and pulsing, hover and click, and the side panel with tour score, record and next opponent. That is a check against the plan's written description. I have not compared the rendered layout pixel for pixel with the plan's painted-map description, and I have not run the full line-by-line audit of PLAN.md.\n\nSo the stop condition stays unmet, for the audit alone. The bundled HTML is at `Zonefire-Basketball-claude-haiku-5-5-medium-20261104-061830.html` in the work folder root, and `exit-interview.json` parses. The final bundle passes 80 headless, 3 browser and 4 hub harness tests.\n\n## Source Information\n- **Date:** 2026-11-04 06:18:30\n- **Source:** Basketball, over-the-top arcade style (genre inspiration; an original game)\n- **Plan:** PLAN.md; title ZONEFIRE drawn this run with a real RNG from 50 candidates\n- **Genre and perspective:** arcade sports, 2-on-2 basketball; side-on broadcast camera, optional High camera\n- **Tech:** my-3D2dge v0.85.2 (modified), AI Hub client 1.4.0 (unmodified), plain JavaScript, Canvas 2D, Web Audio\n- **Testing:** 80 headless, 3 browser, 4 hub scenarios; all pass on the final build\n- **Model:** Anthropic, claude-haiku-5-5, reasoning effort medium\n\n## Testing Feedback\n- About 15 issues caught, four game-breaking. Most helpful: full CPU-vs-CPU matches. Least helpful: the hub harness as a black box; its stalls came from my test's missing `auto=1`.\n\n## Engine Feedback\n- Liked most: the HD rigs, `E.TileMap` with `floorTex`, `game.advance` for headless tests. Stuck on `E.arc`'s apex being a rise, and on the canvas needing `document.body`. One change: a documented hook for hand targets and lean.\n\n## Prompt Feedback\n- Liked most: the milestones and test list. Confusing: the folder and file naming differs between the goal and STAGE.md. Would change: build a playable core first, then polish."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":801,"cache_read_input_tokens":876203,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":801},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0432b045-5008-4207-9914-efcb595d2dad","uuid":"dd20c299-4d99-4f99-ae4a-4b31376b6db8","timestamp":"2026-11-04T15:00:52.954Z","request_id":"req_011Cgi65U7r5PUF8YGur4C3V"}
